While rummageing around the source to hack looking the improve
somebody's hack so your terminal does not need the clear to end of
line control, I noticed durring testing (i.e. playing) that the
magic money room had was empty with money in the corner.  (that is
----
|..|
|..|
---$	Very bad.)

Again looking for the cause I found that there was some code, clearly
added as a revision causing the problem.  Investigation found the
following SPOILER.  I'll post a bug fix soon.









If you ever find something like "ad ae ar um" written on the floor
you're in for alot of money.  It will only be found at the top
or bottem rows of a room.  Standing on that spot, search for a
secret door.  Once found, step in, search more if needed, and you
will be teleported into the money vault.  Once there, gather the $
and wait for the guard.  When he arives you will have to drop
your money and follow.  The way to get the money past the guard
is to drop it next to him, follow him one unit, go back and pick
it up again, follow after the guard and drop the money next to
him and repeat until you are out.  Of course teleporting will
speed things and be safer.
